iio: adc: sc27xx: UMP9620 (UMS9620's PMIC)

Its own scales and ratios, the battery voltage detection graph (scale 1), calibration from two efuse words per
graph (bits 15:4), and the 26 MHz clock vote in an AON register around each conversion (sprd_adc_pm_reg).
Values from Unisoc's 5.4 driver. The fuel gauge reads the battery temperature and charger voltage through it.

